  "description": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS ADVERTISE PROPERTIES ON FACEBOOK & INSTAGRAM FIRST SO PLEASE MAKE SURE YOU ARE FOLLOWING US THERE – VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST\r\n\r\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS are delighted to present this fantastic 2 bed / 1 bath ground floor apartment to the rental market in Allendale Square, Clonsilla, Dublin 15.\r\n\r\nIdeally located, this property is within easy reach of a host of local amenities including shops, schools, restaurants and public transport links, while Blanchardstown Shopping Centre, the N3 and M50 are also within close proximity.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, bright and spacious living/dining area with a fully fitted kitchen, two generous bedrooms and a main bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe property is ideally suited to a wide range of tenants and offers comfortable, modern living in a highly convenient location.\r\n\r\nContact RAY COOKE LETTINGS today for further information.\r\n\r\nAdditional Features;\r\n\r\n- 2 bed / 1 bath\r\n- Ground floor apartment\r\n- Fantastic condition throughout\r\n- Top quality windows & doors\r\n- Top quality fixtures & fittings\r\n- Top quality flooring\r\n- Very spacious rooms\r\n- Luxurious modern fitted wardrobes\r\n- Fully fitted kitchen\r\n- Peaceful location\r\n- Located in the heart of Clonsilla\r\n- All local amenities within a short stroll\r\n- Ideal for a wide range of tenants\r\n- Viewing highly advised\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS PREFER EMAIL ENQUIRES AS ITS EASIER TO MANAGE, PLEASE FILL IN YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION ON THE RIGHT HANDSIDE AND CLICK THE SEND MESSAGE, WE WILL CONTACT YOU WITH VIEWING DETAILS WHEN THEY ARISE",
